# Download with npm

Install [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) (which includes npm), then run:

```bash
npx degit yin78291-png/Arena-Shooter-AS arena-shooter-as
cd arena-shooter-as
```

Open `aren1.5.html` in your browser to play.

## Download as ZIP

[Download the repository as a ZIP file](https://github.com/yin78291-png/Arena-Shooter-AS/archive/refs/heads/main.zip)
